  "definition": "Holding and Using Allowances",
  "effectiveDate": "2020-02-25",
  "historyNote": "#7888, eff 5-13-03; ss by #9908, INTERIM, eff 5-13-11, EXPIRES: 11-9-11; ss by #10002, eff 10-1-11; ss by #12995, eff 2-25-20",
